# Project context

## Start here

- Onboarding (Spanish): `docs/HANDOFF.md`
- Architecture: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- Fragments feature map: `docs/FRAGMENTS.md`
- Agent rules: `AGENTS.md`

## Stack

- Monorepo: `apps/web` (Next 16), `apps/api` (Hono + Prisma 7), `packages/shared`
- Local: `npm run dev:api` + `npm run dev`; tests: `npm test`
- Cards: `@flesh-and-blood/cards` loaded in memory at API boot — not puzzle DB tables

## Three products (do not merge)

1. **Codex** — `/`, `/profile`
2. **Guess** — `/single`, `/challenge`, `/leaderboard`, `/api/leaderboard`
3. **Fragments** — `/puzzle/*`, `/api/fragments/*` (separate stats & leaderboards)

Brand routing: `apps/web/src/lib/experience-brand.ts`

## Before editing Next.js

Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` — this is Next 16, not legacy App Router assumptions.

## Constraints (common tasks)

- Minimal diffs; match existing patterns; no commits unless user asks
- Fragments phases: do not change Guess leaderboard/stats unless explicitly requested
- Fragments completions are client-trusted in v1 (no server puzzle verification yet)

## Key Fragments files

- API: `apps/api/src/server/fragments-routes.ts`, `fragments-service.ts`, `fragments-leaderboard-service.ts`
- Web: `apps/web/src/features/fragments/`, `apps/web/src/lib/fragments/`
- UI shell: `apps/web/src/components/layout/fragments-header.tsx`
